tree/ holds Yuzuri's own modules, imported under sglang.* names (manifest.json, "modules"). No file of SGLang
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang, Apache-2.0) is carried: hooks/ wraps SGLang's functions at startup, and
manifest.json "sglang_checked" names the SGLang commits the hooks were checked against.

tree/srt/layers/moe/kt_gguf_moe_mmq/llama_mmq/ holds CUDA sources derived from llama.cpp
(https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT); the ggml headers beside them are fetched at setup, not carried.
The MIT license text is LICENSES/MIT-llama.cpp.txt at the repository's top and ggml/LICENSE in that directory.

csrc/kv_vmm.c is deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017-ktransformers's kv-vmm/kv_vmm.c (https://github.com/05yuki/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017-ktransformers,
Apache-2.0) with Yuzuri's changes: host-memory chunks placed per range, every chunk a range touches restored and
placed, the mapped-bytes count the ledger reads. setup.sh --package builds it into tree/srt/layers/moe/libkv_vmm.so.
